{"title":"Velocio Adds New LUXE, ONE, and TRAIL Apparel for Fall and Winter Riding","link":"https://bikerumor.com/velocio-adds-new-luxe-one-and-trail-apparel-for-fall-and-winter-riding/","date":1790369849000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-23-1536x1024.jpeg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Fresh cycling apparel from Velocio for fall and winter riding. (All photos / Velocio)\" /></p>\n<p>Velocio makes some of the finest cycling apparel in the industry, and the brand is constantly updating existing models or adding new pieces to its various lineups. For fall/winter 2026, the brand recently introduced several new garments designed to be adaptable and help take the guesswork out of dressing for fall riding. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>For road and gravel riders, the <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/velocio-luxe-collection-wool-jersey/\">LUXE collection</a> grows with new vests, jackets, and accessories, along with the new ONE Thermal Bib Tights. On the <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/velocio-mtb-clothing-new-off-road-equipment/\">mountain bike side</a>, the brand-new TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve and Air Pullover offer more options for riding in cool temperatures while chasing the best conditions of the year.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15.jpeg\"><img width=\"1904\" height=\"1269\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15.jpeg\" alt=\"two gravel riders wearing velocio apparel\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15.jpeg 1904w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Fall-Apparel-15-1350x900.jpeg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>“<em>Nobody wants to stand in their kitchen every morning trying to solve a weather puzzle</em>,” said Velocio design director and co-founder Brad Sheehan. “<em>We designed this collection to simplify that moment. These pieces work together to perform across changing conditions so that you can start pedalling without overthinking or overpacking</em>.”</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>LUXE Air Vest and Jacket</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio LUXE Air Vest from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRVEST_DarkSulfur-1333-1-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a><figcaption>LUXE Air Vest</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio LUXE Air Jacket from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_MERINO_AIRJACKET_DarkSlate-0761-1-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a><figcaption>LUXE Air Jacket</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Velocio is adding to its popular LUXE line with the new Air Vest and Air Jacket. Both are designed to “<em>deliver exceptional warmth in a lightweight build that wears more like a jersey than a winter jacket</em>.” Of course, the jacket has full sleeves while the vest does not; otherwise, they feature the same materials and construction. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>With body-mapped active insulation and a protective shell up front, and jersey-weight fleece on the back, the LUXE Air Vest and Jacket aim to provide wind and weather protection with reliable, adaptable thermal regulation. Both have two-way zippers and come in men’s and women’s versions in Dark Slate and Dark Sulphur colorways.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio LUXE Air Jacket from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_AIRJACKET_DARKSLATE-0822-1-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a><figcaption>LUXE Air Jacket</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio LUXE Air Vest from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LUXE_ALPHA_AIRVEST_DARKSULFUR-1500-1-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a><figcaption>LUXE Air Vest</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Japanese-milled 55g, 100% recycled polyester front body fabric</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Body-mapped 80g active insulation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fleece back (and underarms on jacket) to improve breathability</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Performance-focused on-bike fit reduces flapping-Two-way front zipper</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Colors: Dark Slate, Dark Sulphur</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sizes: Men: XS – XXXXL, Women: XXS – XXXL</li>\n\n\n\n<li>LUXE Air Vest MSRP: $229 </li>\n\n\n\n<li>LUXE Air Jacket MSRP: $269</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2>ONE Thermal Bib Tights</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio ONE thermal Bib Tights from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-3-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio ONE thermal Bib Tights from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-1-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Velocio calls the new ONE Thermal Bib Tight “<em>a versatile three-season workhorse with balanced compression for mid-distance rides and lightweight thermal insulation for everything from cool mornings to brisk winter days</em>.” According to the brand, it slots in between the standard LUXE Bib Tight and the LUXE Thermal Bib Tight in terms of warmth and protection from the elements. It’s warmer than the former, but not as insulating, windproof, or compressive as the latter — striking a balance for riders who only want ONE bib tight for all their cool-cold weather riding.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The ONE Thermal Bib Tight is made from a recycled thermal fabric with a lightweight fleece lining and moderate compression for mid-distance rides. It features Velocio’s multi-density Signature Chamois, and the women’s version includes the FreeFly design to facilitate bathroom breaks without the need to remove layers.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpeg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpeg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio ONE thermal Bib Tights from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpeg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Womens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-900x900.jpeg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio ONE thermal Bib Tights from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mens-ONE-Bib-Tight-4-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Recycled thermal fabric and lightweight fleece lining</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Moderate compression for mid-distance versatility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full-length coverage for cool to cold weather riding</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Signature chamois combines multi-density layers with refined edges and a perforated top</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Designed in the on-bike position for pedaling without constriction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>FlyFree design on Women’s for easy bathroom breaks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Color: Black</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sizes: Men: XS – XXXXL, Women: XXS – XXXL</li>\n\n\n\n<li>MSRP: $199</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2>TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18.jpeg\"><img width=\"2200\" height=\"1467\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18.jpeg\" alt=\"a male and female mountain biking in the forest while wearing the Velocio TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18.jpeg 2200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-2048x1366.jpeg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-18-1350x900.jpeg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption>The TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve pairs a grid-knit heavyweight merino blend with a breathable midweight mesh back.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve was designed to be an all-day essential for mountain biking once the temperatures drop. It features a grid-knit heavyweight merino blend fabric on the front and arms with a midweight mesh back for breathability. The denser front and arm fabric stands up to brushes with trailside obstacles and blocks a little wind, while the grid texture inside is claimed to “<em>lift off your skin to trap warmth while creating channels that move air, wicking away sweat and excess heat</em>.” </p>\n\n\n\n<p>The TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve comes in men’s and women’s versions in three colors: Black, Rocky Ridge (beige), and Deep Forest. We’ve got one in for testing and will follow up with a review in the near future.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_ROCKRIDGE-0224-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio TRAIL Merino Long Sleeve from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TRAIL_MERINO_LS_DEEPFOREST-0971-1-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Materials: 75% polyamide, 25% virgin wool</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Heavyweight grid construction, front and arms</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Midweight mesh back for breathability</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Boxy fit looks casual without being so loose it snags</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Colors: Black, Rock Ridge, and Deep Forest</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sizes: Men: XS – XXXXL, Women: XXS – XXXL</li>\n\n\n\n<li>MSRP: $119</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2>Air Pullover</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41.jpeg\"><img width=\"2200\" height=\"1467\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41.jpeg\" alt=\"a man wearing the Velocio Air Pullover in red while preparing to go for ride.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41.jpeg 2200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-2048x1366.jpeg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-41-1350x900.jpeg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption>The Air Pullover pairs super-light, high-loft fleece on the body with merino grid sleeves.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The all-new Air Pullover is designed to be worn on its own or as a cold-weather layering piece, whether you’re on the bike or not. It features a featherlight 95g high-loft fleece covering the front, shoulders, and back, paired with merino grid sleeves. Velocio says the fleece body “<em>traps heat when you’re taking it easy, and turbocharges breathability and wicking when you’re on the move</em>.” Meanwhile, the merino-grid sleeves add durability and also aid with thermal regulation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Velocio says that it’s a great piece to wear on its own while riding, to the trailhead, or kicking it around the house. When temperatures are frigid, layer it under a shell and/or add a base layer to crank up the warmth. Like all of the other Velocio pieces listed here, the Air Pullover comes in men’s and women’s versions. We’ve also got one of these in for testing and will follow up with a review once it’s cool enough to try it out.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a man wearing the Velocio Air Pullover from the rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_REDOCHRE-0539-1-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1.jpg\" alt=\"studio image of a woman wearing the Velocio Air Pullover from the front\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AIR_PULLOVER_BLACK-1030-1-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Hybrid construction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>High-loft lightweight fleece main body</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Merino grid sleeves</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Active insulation stretches, breathes, and thermoregulates</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easily worn as a layer or standalone piece</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Relaxed, boxy, pullover cut</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Colors: Red Ochre, Black</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sizes: Men: XS – XXXXL, Women: XXS – XXXL</li>\n\n\n\n<li>MSRP: $189</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2.jpeg\"><img width=\"2200\" height=\"1467\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2.jpeg\" alt=\"a woman riding a mountain bike while wearing Velocio's new Trail Merino Long Sleeve.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2.jpeg 2200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-2048x1366.jpeg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FW26-Trail-Apparel-2-1350x900.jpeg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Availability</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>All of Velocio’s new and updated fall/winter 2026 cycling apparel is available now. Head to the Velocio website to learn more, see the brand’s full lineup of cycling apparel, or pick up some fresh threads for the cool temperatures and inclement weather ahead.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=cl&amp;mi=17985&amp;pw=293233&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.velocio.cc%2F\">velocio.cc</a></em></p>","author":"Jeremy Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/velocio-adds-new-luxe-one-and-trail-apparel-for-fall-and-winter-riding/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"24728c7b94acc649ef526c85b03716ad28769e17e905365454d65c3f6421c9be","category":"Cycling"}